# Installation

[= project_name =] runs on Linux and macOS, with Python 3.10 or newer.

=== "pip"

    ```bash
    pip install [= distribution =]
    ```

=== "uv"

    ```bash
    uv tool install [= distribution =]   # the command
    uv add [= distribution =]            # a project's dependency
    ```
[% if bioconda %]

=== "conda"

    ```bash
    conda install -c conda-forge -c bioconda [= distribution =]
    ```
[% endif %]
[% if image %]

=== "Docker"

    ```bash
    docker run --rm ghcr.io/[= owner | lower =]/[= distribution | lower =]:latest [= command =] --help
    ```
[% endif %]

`[= command =] --version` says which version is installed.
